  { id: "R-0152", name: "Quiet Light Podcast", type: "Podcast", url: "https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-quiet-light-podcast/id1034903908", description: "Learn the skills and methods you need to turn your online business into a powerful profit engine that you can sell when you want, for the price you designate, to the buyer you choose. Our hosts Joe Valley and Mark Daoust, along with leading M & A, ecommerce, SaaS, marketing, and content experts, will share their decades of experience to give you the tools you need to buy, scale, and exit an online business on your terms.\n\n\nThe Quiet Light Podcast is your best source for actionable insights from innovative and successful entrepreneurs who have built, bought, and sold online businesses. If you want to benefit from the most successful strategies and thought leadership to propel yourself toward your goals, look no further.", newsInsight: "Learn the skills and methods you need to turn your online business into a powerful profit engine that you can sell when you want, for the price you designate, to the buyer you choose. Our hosts Joe Valley and Mark Daoust, along with leading M & A, ecommerce, SaaS, marketing, and content experts, will share their decades of experience to give you the tools you need to buy, scale, and exit an online business on your terms.\n\n\nThe Quiet Light Podcast is your best source for actionable insights from innovative and successful entrepreneurs who have built, bought, and sold online businesses. If you want to benefit from the most successful strategies and thought leadership to propel yourself toward your goals, look no further.", author: undefined, host: "Joe Valley; Mark Daoust", rating: undefined, ratingCount: undefined, yearPublished: undefined, tags: ["Growing or Scaling"], coverImageUrl: "https://dl.airtable.com/.attachments/42200d0bedfb0642f9db8888fbced99c/bc7d74a9/313x0w4.webp", source: "Searchfunder Podcasts & Vlogs Gallery", fullTitle: undefined, dateAdded: "2026-06-19" }